              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બેઠક — beṭhak — \"meeting; sitting room\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "આજે બપોરે બેઠક છે. — āje bapore beṭhak che — \"There is a meeting this afternoon.\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
