          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બેઠક (beṭhak), a sitting together, is built on beṭh-, a stem of the taught besvũ, \"to sit\", with -ak. CDIAL derives besvũ and beṭho from Sanskrit úpaviśati, \"sits down\" (CDIAL 2245)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
