              "text": "સહી કરવી (sahī karvī) is built from sahī, \"signature\", and karvī, \"to do\". Sahī is usually traced to Arabic ṣaḥīḥ, \"sound, correct\", through Persian; its Arabic root is ṣ-ḥ-ḥ (Lane)."
